// CHECK: 'missing_body' is not found
// CHECK: 'missing_class_body' is not found
// CHECK: duplicate lambda parameter 'x'
// CHECK: Incompatible type: expected 'int64', but got 'str'.
// CHECK: 'missing_nested' is not found
// CHECK: lambda parameter 'x' needs a type
// CHECK: lambda variable captures are not implemented yet
// CHECK: lambda variable captures are not implemented yet
// CHECK: lambda variable captures are not implemented yet
// CHECK: lambda variable captures are not implemented yet
